---
title: "Figure 7.2.8 - Upload Real Call Recording"
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant IngestGW as Ingestion Gateway
    participant IngestCtrl as Ingest Controller
    participant StorageSvc as Storage Service
    participant MediaRepo as Media Repository
    participant S3 as S3/MinIO Bucket
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    User->>IngestGW: POST /ingest/upload/init<br/>{mimeType, sizeBytes}
    IngestGW->>IngestCtrl: Forward request

    IngestCtrl->>IngestCtrl: Validate file type & size
    alt Invalid file
        IngestCtrl-->>User: 400 Invalid File
    end

    IngestCtrl->>StorageSvc: Initialize upload
    StorageSvc->>StorageSvc: Generate unique storageKey
    StorageSvc->>MediaRepo: Create MediaAsset<br/>{status: "uploading"}
    MediaRepo-->>StorageSvc: Asset created {assetId}

    StorageSvc->>S3: Generate pre-signed multipart URLs
    S3-->>StorageSvc: Upload URLs

    StorageSvc-->>IngestCtrl: Upload details
    IngestCtrl-->>User: 200 OK<br/>{assetId, uploadUrls[]}

    loop For each part
        User->>IngestGW: POST /ingest/upload/part<br/>{partNumber, contentRange}
        IngestGW->>IngestCtrl: Forward part
        IngestCtrl->>StorageSvc: Validate & store part
        StorageSvc->>S3: Upload part
        S3-->>StorageSvc: Part stored
        StorageSvc-->>IngestCtrl: Part complete
        IngestCtrl-->>User: 200 OK
    end

    User->>IngestGW: POST /ingest/upload/complete<br/>{assetId}
    IngestGW->>IngestCtrl: Finalize upload

    IngestCtrl->>StorageSvc: Complete multipart upload
    StorageSvc->>S3: Combine all parts
    S3-->>StorageSvc: File ready

    StorageSvc->>MediaRepo: Update MediaAsset<br/>{status: "ready", generate signed URL}
    MediaRepo-->>StorageSvc: Updated

    StorageSvc->>EventBus: Emit media.ingested<br/>{assetId}

    StorageSvc-->>IngestCtrl: Upload complete
    IngestCtrl-->>User: 200 OK<br/>{assetId, confirmation}

---
title: "Figure 7.2.9 - Process Uploaded Recording (Transcription)"
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant IngestGW as Ingestion Gateway
    participant IngestCtrl as Ingest Controller
    participant MediaRepo as Media Repository
    participant JobRepo as IngestionJob Repository
    participant Worker as Background Worker
    participant StorageSvc as Storage Service
    participant S3 as S3/MinIO
    participant TranscribeSvc as Transcribe Service
    participant STTAPI as Whisper/Azure STT
    participant TranscriptRepo as Transcript Repository
    participant DiarizeSvc as Diarization Service
    participant SpeakerRepo as Speaker Repository
    participant EnrichSvc as Enrichment Service
    participant EnrichRepo as Enrichment Repository
    participant IndexerSvc as Indexer Service
    participant EmbeddingRepo as Embedding Repository (pgvector)
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    User->>IngestGW: POST /ingest/jobs<br/>{assetId, pipeline: "transcribe_enrich"}
    IngestGW->>IngestCtrl: Forward request

    IngestCtrl->>MediaRepo: Validate asset exists
    alt Asset not found
        MediaRepo-->>IngestCtrl: Not found
        IngestCtrl-->>User: 404 Asset Not Found
    end
    MediaRepo-->>IngestCtrl: Asset valid

    IngestCtrl->>JobRepo: Create IngestionJob<br/>{status: "queued", pipeline}
    JobRepo-->>IngestCtrl: Job created {jobId}

    IngestCtrl-->>User: 200 OK (async)<br/>{jobId}

    Note over Worker: Background worker picks up job

    Worker->>JobRepo: Update job<br/>{status: "running", startedAt}

    Worker->>StorageSvc: Retrieve media file
    StorageSvc->>S3: Get file by storageKey
    S3-->>StorageSvc: Media file
    StorageSvc-->>Worker: File data

    Worker->>TranscribeSvc: Process audio
    TranscribeSvc->>STTAPI: Batch transcription<br/>(with diarization)
    STTAPI-->>TranscribeSvc: Full transcript + speakers + timestamps

    TranscribeSvc->>TranscriptRepo: Create Transcript<br/>{text, language}
    TranscriptRepo-->>TranscribeSvc: Transcript created {transcriptId}

    TranscribeSvc->>DiarizeSvc: Process speaker changes
    DiarizeSvc->>SpeakerRepo: Create Speaker records
    SpeakerRepo-->>DiarizeSvc: Speakers created

    TranscribeSvc->>TranscriptRepo: Create TranscriptSegment records<br/>(linked to speakers)

    alt Pipeline includes enrichment
        Worker->>EnrichSvc: Process transcript

        Note over EnrichSvc: NER: Extract entities<br/>(companies, products, people)

        Note over EnrichSvc: Topic modeling:<br/>Extract main themes

        Note over EnrichSvc: Sentiment analysis:<br/>Score emotional tone

        EnrichSvc->>EnrichRepo: Create Enrichment<br/>{summary, topics, sentiment, entities}
        EnrichRepo-->>EnrichSvc: Enrichment saved
    end

    Worker->>JobRepo: Update job<br/>{status: "completed", transcriptId, completedAt}

    alt Pipeline is "full"
        Worker->>IndexerSvc: Generate embeddings
        Note over IndexerSvc: Use sentence transformer<br/>for each segment
        IndexerSvc->>EmbeddingRepo: Store embeddings (pgvector)<br/>{namespace, refType, refId, vector}
        EmbeddingRepo-->>IndexerSvc: Embeddings indexed
    end

    Worker->>EventBus: Emit analytics.updated<br/>{transcriptId, jobId}
